  instructions        181G  ± 6.31M      181G  …  181G           0 ( 0%)        ⚡-  3.9% ±  0.0%
  cache_references   5.48G  ± 17.5M     5.46G  … 5.50G           0 ( 0%)        ⚡-  6.9% ±  1.0%
